<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Chrȳsŏgŏnus</span></b> ,
			i, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> L. Cornelius, <i>a
				freedman of Sylla.</i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A slave of Verres</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 1, 36, §
			92</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A player on the cithara</i>, <i><span class="en">Juv. 6,
			74</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Rosc. Am. 2, 6</span></i>; cf.
					<i><span class="en">id. ib. 43, 124</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
